cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to IndexOne in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "IndexOne"
abstract: >-
  IndexOne is a local-first macOS app that records meetings, transcribes them on-device
  with Whisper, writes structured notes as plain Markdown, and answers questions across
  everything recorded with Ivy, its AI assistant. Ivy can run on the Mac or, after
  explicit consent, through redacted cloud providers.
authors:
  - name: "MonoOne"
    website: "https://github.com/monoone-dev"
url: "https://index-one.io"
repository-artifact: "https://github.com/monoone-dev/index-one-landing-page/releases"
keywords:
  - macos
  - meeting notes
  - transcription
  - whisper
  - on-device ai
  - local-first
  - obsidian
  - model context protocol
